er at Chakpikarong (Chindwin River basin), Manipur, India (Fig. 5). The new species was collected from a swift-flowing riffle, over a substrate of gravel and bed rock (Fig. 6). Co-occurring species collected from the type locality includes members of the genera Balitora, Channa, Glyptothorax, Mastacembelus, Neolissochilus, Psilorhynchus, Schistura and Tor.","","text","",""]]},"Q4GR7":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"Q562G":{"d":[["Japan","JP","iso","native",""],["Japan","JP","iso","native",""],["Japan","JP","iso","native",""]]},"QCXBG":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"QDFCW":{"d":[["Yunnan","","text","",""]]},"QL2SS":{"d":[["ZA, Eastern Cape","","text","native",""]]},"QMN8Q":{"d":[["Distribution in Iran: Iran (no locality cited) (Horák 2008).","","text","",""]]},"QYTGP":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","",""]]},"R2H2W":{"d":[["Global","","text","native","data deficient"]]},"RCK5":{"d":[["","MXE","tdwg","",""]]},"RCRJD":{"d":[["Iraqi part of the Persian Gulf","25407","mrgid","native",""]]},"RLCMG":{"d":[["France","48144","mrgid","native",""]]},"S8YXY":{"d":[["Southern Asia","","text","",""]]},"SB5DG":{"d":[["Algeria","47949","mrgid","native",""]]},"SDF8":{"d":[["South America","","text","",""]]},"SSGH":{"d":[["","CMN","tdwg","",""],["","GAB","tdwg","",""],["","IVO","tdwg","",""],["","LBR","tdwg","",""],["","SIE","tdwg","",""]]},"SXSDS":{"d":[["Eastern Caribbean","21978","mrgid","native",""]]},"T7DCC":{"d":[["Sweden","SE","iso","native","not evaluated"]]},"TPYLL":{"d":[["Australasia","","text","native",""]]},"TTN7H":{"d":[["Distribution: The know range is restricted to the Atlantic Forest along the coastlines of Rio de Janeiro and Espírito Santo; possibly also occurs in southern Bahia.","","text","",""]]},"V2GDB":{"d":[["Distribution and habitat data. The species is known only from Wumengshan N. R. in northeast Yunnan. The specimen was collected by sifting leaf litter at an altitude of 1709 m. Comparative notes. The new species is very similar to N. guohaoi in